{
  "_comment": "Copy to config/taxonomy.json and edit. 'status' is how YOU stand on each skill: have = you can do it | partial = some exposure | gap = you don't have it. 'close_via' = how you'd close a gap (course | portfolio | cv-reframe | skip). 'patterns' = case-insensitive regex matched against job title + description (add your languages). 'role_segments' classify a job by title for the market report. All values below are generic placeholders — make them yours.",
